      "sourceTextSha256": "e8f866a74ecc0326eddbca75b68665c2fd403e1bf6978ddbb1f0bb2f909aaa17",
      "text": "**3-day / 2-night programme**\n\nAt 08:00, transfer from your hotel in Manaus to Mamori Lodge.\n\nLeave the port and cross the Negro and Solimões rivers, stopping at the Meeting of the Waters. Continue for about 40 km along a paved road, then switch to private river transport. The river leg takes around 50 minutes.\n\nOn arrival, enjoy a welcome drink and check in.\n\nAt noon: lunch.  \nAt 02:00: get to know the area and prepare your fishing gear.  \nAt 03:00: fishing.  \nAt 07:00: dinner and free time.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261110-98c5fe36c1a7",
